      "max_chars": 24,
      "source_sample_chars": 10,
      "source_text": "01.项目启动与规划",
      "bounds_pt": [
        43.2,
        291.2,
        184.1,
        29.1
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_20",
      "shape_id": 20,
      "shape_name": "文本框 19",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 148,
      "source_sample_chars": 74,
      "source_text": "目标设定：明确项目的目标、范围、交付物和时间节点。\n资源分配：确定所需的人员、资金和设备等资源。\n制定详细计划：包括工作分解结构、时间表和任务分配。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        43.2,
        320.5,
        184.1,
        124.7
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_21",
      "shape_id": 21,
      "shape_name": "文本框 20",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 24,
      "source_sample_chars": 10,
      "source_text": "02.项目执行与监控",
      "bounds_pt": [
        251.2,
        166.9,
        184.1,
        29.1
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_22",
      "shape_id": 22,
      "shape_name": "文本框 21",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 170,
      "source_sample_chars": 85,
      "source_text": "任务分配：根据项目计划分配具体任务给团队成员，并设定优先级。\n进度跟踪：定期检查项目进展，确保任务按时完成，解决执行中的问题。\n质量控制：确保工作成果符合标准和质量要求。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        251.2,
        196.2,
        184.1,
        124.7
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_23",
      "shape_id": 23,
      "shape_name": "文本框 22",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 24,
      "source_sample_chars": 10,
      "source_text": "03.项目调整与优化",
      "bounds_pt": [
        457.0,
        82.8,
        184.1,
        29.1
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_24",
      "shape_id": 24,
      "shape_name": "文本框 23",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 114,
      "source_sample_chars": 57,
      "source_text": "问题解决：根据反馈实际执行情况，调整项目策略或资源分配。\n过程优化：通过监控与评估，识别并优化工作流程，提高效率。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        457.0,
        112.1,
        184.1,
        83.3
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
